# AFTERBELL reference-data credentials.
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Alpaca is used for REFERENCE PRICE ONLY - last regular-session trade,
# session calendar, and corporate announcements. No orders are ever placed.
# Market-data endpoints are read-only.
ALPACA_API_KEY=
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=

# Binance market data requires NO credentials (Law 10). The recorder holds
# no token by design and cannot die from OAuth expiry. Do not add one here.
